r Investments             -53.46  -115.52   -115.90\par   Reserve assets                 60.28    26.65    113.00\par  IV. NET LENDING                 -0.74   -19.32     -2.25\par   Net errors and omissions       16.89    28.69      2.17\par     \par     Details on \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.cnb.cz/en/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.cnb.cz/en/index.html}}}\uc2 \f2 \par     \par     NOTE. All 2016 figures are subject to revision. The 2015\par figures are revised. The CNB releases the monthly figures\par according to ECB methodology.\par     \par  \par \par ($1 = 24.0990 Czech crowns)\par \par  (Reporting by Mirka Krufova; Editing by Jason Hovet)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-10-14T09:01:49.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020161014ecae00ccx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
