\par\par \b \uc2 Czech Republic - Factors To Watch on Sept 16\b0\par\par\uc2 521 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 2015\par 08:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PRAGUE, Sept 16 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press\par reports and events to watch which may affect Czech financial\par markets on Wednesday. \par        \par     ALL TIMES GMT (Czech Republic: GMT + 2 hours)         \par =========================ECONOMIC DATA========================\par     August producer prices data 0700 GMT.\par     Real-time economic data releases................... \par     Previous stories on Czech data............ \par     Overview of economic data and forecasts......... \par     Updates on CEE \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ........................... \par ===========================EVENTS==============================\par     PRAGUE - \f28 \uc2 \f2 Czech \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governing board to hold a\par regular weekly meeting. It is not scheduled to discuss monetary\par policy issues.\par     Related news:       \par     PRAGUE - The lower house of parliament to continue a\par session.\par     Related news:       \par ===========================NEWS================================ \par   \par     MIGRANTS: Hungary's right-wing government shut the main land\par route for migrants into the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European Union\f28 \uc2 \f2  on Tuesday, taking\par matters into its own hands to halt Europe's influx of refugees.\par     Story: Related news: \par     \par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX INTERVENTIONS\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 : The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Czech Republic\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  needs to\par see inflation overshooting its 2 percent target in its policy\par forecasts before it considers exiting its weak crown policy,\par board member Jiri Rusnok was quoted as saying on Tuesday.\par     Story: Related news: \par \par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX INTERVENTIONS\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 : The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Czech \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may be forced to\par not only prolong its loose policy regime but to also ease\par monetary conditions further depending on pressures from the euro\par zone, board member \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lubomir Lizal\f28 \uc2 \f2  was quoted as saying on\par Tuesday.\par     Story: Related news: \par     \par     CEE MARKETS: Central European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  were mixed in early\par trading on Tuesday, with Hungary's forint edging up before a\par U.S. interest rate decision this week.\par     Story: Related news: \par \par     CEE POWER: Forecasts for dwindling wind and low solar power\par generation drove Czech and Slovak spot power prices higher on\par Tuesday while Hungarian and Romanian day-ahead prices eased on\par lower demand in the Balkans, traders said.\par     Story: Related news: \par ---------------------- MARKET SNAPSHOT ------------------------\par  Index/Crown \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest     Prev   Pct change Pct change\par                                     close    on day     in 2015\par  vs Euro        27.061     27.049    -0.04       2.14\par  vs Dollar         23.99      23.93     -0.25      -5.07\par  Czech Equities  1,001.3    1,001.3       0.04       5.77\par  U.S. Equities 16,599.85  16,370.96      1.4       -6.86\par  Pvs close or current levels vs prior domestic close at 1500 GMT\par ======================PRESS DIGEST============================\par     MIGRANTS: Czechs plan to close their borders in case at\par least 750 migrants a day would enter the country for several\par days in a row, documents presented to the paper showed.\par     Pravo,