 standards for corporate\par loans to ease further in the third quarter while demand is set\par to grow, mostly from large businesses, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's July\par lending survey showed on Monday.\par     Story: Related news: \par     \par     CEE MARKETS: The Czech crown hovered close to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's cap of around 27 to the euro on Monday, and investors\par were on the lookout for official \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to prevent any\par further strengthening.\par     Story: Related news: \par \par     CEE POWER: Coal and nuclear power plant outages along with\par warm weather that spurred demand across the region sent Czech,\par Slovak and Hungarian day ahead power prices soaring on Monday,\par traders said.\par     Story: Related news: \par ---------------------- MARKET SNAPSHOT ------------------------\par  Index/Crown \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest     Prev   Pct change Pct change\par                                     close    on day     in 2015\par  vs Euro        27.085     27.063    -0.08       2.05\par  vs Dollar         25.008     24.931    -0.31      -9.53\par  Czech Equities  1,030.18   1,030.18      0.51       8.82\par  U.S. Equities 18,100.41  18,086.45      0.08       1.56\par  Pvs close or current levels vs prior domestic close at 1500 GMT\par  \par ======================PRESS DIGEST============================\par     REALITIES: Financial group PPF of the richest Czech, Petr\par Kellner, bought an office complex in Moscow for estimated $370\par million, in cooperation with investment fund Hines. The\par companies did not reveal their shares or the price paid.\par     Hospodarske Noviny, page 12\par     \par     \par     Reuters has not verified the media reports, nor does it \par vouch for their accuracy.\par    \par  For Instant Views of key 