\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-\uc2 Czech  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  hits crown with  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  comment\b0\par\par\uc2 379 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Mai 2013\par 16:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Bank debating \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  "quite often", says governor Singer\par \par \uc2 * Crown eases to one-week low\par \par \uc2 * Says commercial banks' profitability is falling\par \par \uc2 (Adds details, comment)\par \par \uc2 PRAGUE, May 7 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  often discusses \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the crown, its governor said, in comments that hit the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In a presentation at an economic conference on Tuesday, Singer also said Czech lenders were facing increased pressure to cut margins and their profits may fall in coming years.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut the key two-week repo rate to 0.05 percent in November and said that, if it needed to ease policy further, it would use \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the crown.\par \par \uc2 Inflation is falling in the \b \highlight22\uc2 Czech Republic\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has been locked in a recession since mid-2011.\par \par \uc2 "We are discussing \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  quite often now," Singer said. The crown eased to a one-week low of 25.80 to the euro\par \par \uc2 after the comment, from 25.748 earlier, according to Reuters data.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been on a downward path since the rate cut, falling to a 17-month low in April and removing the need for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to step into the market.\par \par \uc2 A weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  makes imports more expensive, raising inflation which has dropped below the bank's 2 percent target. It would also raise exporters' revenues.\par \par \uc2 Some central bankers have however warned that a weaker crown would further crimp household demand, suppressed by three years of austerity measures.\par \par \uc2 BANKS UNDER PRESSURE\par \par \uc2 Czechs' thrift has also hit lending, causing loan growth to households to slow, Singer said, and consumer loans have been shrinking since 2011.\par \par \uc2 That has hit banks whose margins are also under pressure from the record low interest rates.\par \par \uc2 Lender \uc2 Komercni Banka\uc2  said on Tuesday net profit fell by almost 10 percent in the first quarter, citing falling interest margins and fees.\par \par \uc2 "We think that (banks) will not be able to create such (big) profits as they did in the past, which does not mean that they will not be able to create very decent profits in the European context," Singer said.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Jana Mlcochova; Editing by John Stonestreet)\par \par \uc2 CZECH-CBANK/ (UPDATE 1) | CZS | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | RNP | DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130507e957000s2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
