\par\par \b \uc2 Czech c.banker:  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  is next best tool for easing\b0\par\par\uc2 158 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Dezember 2012\par 17:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 PRAGUE, Dec 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the best available tool for the \uc2 Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  now that interest rates are close to zero, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board member Lubomir Lizal was quoted as saying on Monday.\par \par \uc2 "The natural question is what's next. For a small, open economy like the \b \highlight22\uc2 Czech Republic\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in current conditions \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is the best second tool you have," Lizal said in an interview with Dow Jones.\par \par \uc2 He said the bank's latest outlook suggested further monetary easing in the middle of next year, adding he is comfortable with this estimation. Lizal added he did not favour a particular \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate for the crown.\par \par \uc2 The bank cut its main rate to 0.05 percent in November.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Jason Hovet; Editing by Toby Chopra)\par \par \uc2 CZECH-CBANK/LIZAL (URGENT) | CZS | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | RNP | DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020121210e8ca000zd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
